  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:2-john:1:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "The elder unto the elect lady and her children, whom I love in the truth; and not I only, but also all they that have known the truth;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "2 John 1:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:2-john:1:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:2-john:1:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "For the truth’s sake, which dwelleth in us, and shall be with us for ever.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "2 John 1:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:2-john:1:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:2-john:1:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "Grace be with you, mercy, and peace, from God the Father, and from the Lord Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, in truth and love.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "2 John 1:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:2-john:1:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:2-john:1:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "I rejoiced greatly that I found of thy children walking in truth, as we have received a commandment from the Father.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "2 John 1:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:2-john:1:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:2-john:1:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "And now I beseech thee, lady, not as though I wrote a new commandment unto thee, but that which we had from the beginning, that we love one another.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "2 John 1:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:2-john:1:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:2-john:1:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "And this is love, that we walk after his commandments. This is the commandment, That, as ye have heard from the beginning, ye should walk in it.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "2 John 1:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:2-john:1:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:2-john:1:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "For many deceivers are entered into the world, who confess not that Jesus Christ is come in the flesh. This is a deceiver and an antichrist.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "2 John 1:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:2-john:1:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:2-john:1:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "Look to yourselves, that we lose not those things which we have wrought, but that we receive a full reward.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "2 John 1:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:2-john:1:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:2-john:1:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "Whosoever transgresseth, and abideth not in the doctrine of Christ, hath not God. He that abideth in the doctrine of Christ, he hath both the Father and the Son.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "2 John 1:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:2-john:1:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:2-john:1:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "If there come any unto you, and bring not this doctrine, receive him not into your house, neither bid him God speed:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "2 John 1:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:2-john:1:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:2-john:1:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "For he that biddeth him God speed is partaker of his evil deeds.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "2 John 1:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:2-john:1:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:2-john:1:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "Having many things to write unto you, I would not write with paper and ink: but I trust to come unto you, and speak face to face, that our joy may be full.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "2 John 1:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:2-john:1:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:2-john:1:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "The children of thy elect sister greet thee. Amen.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "2 John 1:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:2-john:1:13"
      }
    }
  ],
  "source": {
